WEBVTT

00:10:58.668 --> 00:11:00.149
limit who they know,

00:11:00.173 --> 00:11:02.547
what they know, how they think,

00:11:02.571 --> 00:11:04.971
how they speak, and where they work.

00:11:06.181 --> 00:11:08.749
That new piece of capital,
that new person to date

00:11:08.773 --> 00:11:12.452
almost always comes
from outside the inner circle.

00:11:12.476 --> 00:11:15.974
New things come
from what are called our weak ties,

00:11:15.998 --> 00:11:18.215
our friends of friends of friends.

00:11:18.866 --> 00:11:23.009
So yes, half of twentysomethings
are un- or under-employed.

00:11:23.731 --> 00:11:25.047
But half aren't,

00:11:25.071 --> 00:11:28.030
and weak ties are how
you get yourself into that group.

00:11:28.831 --> 00:11:31.400
Half of new jobs are never posted,